{"nodes": [{"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance", "label": "tax-compliance agent (virtual account manager)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L1-L73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_get_annual_report", "label": "get_annual_report MCP tool (\u05d3\u05d5\u05d7 \u05e9\u05e0\u05ea\u05d9)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L14-L19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Covers every income source through deductions, brackets and credits down to \u05d9\u05ea\u05e8\u05d4 \u05dc\u05ea\u05e9\u05dc\u05d5\u05dd. The app computes it from the books, so the agent reads it instead of re-deriving figures from the sheets."}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_get_tax_report", "label": "get_tax_report MCP tool (\u05de\u05e2\"\u05de periods)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L20-L22", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Its income-tax half prices business profit as the only income, badly understating tax for someone who also draws a salary, so it is used for VAT only."}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_list_documents_tools", "label": "list_invoices / list_expenses MCP tools", "file_type": "code", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_annual_outlook", "label": "Annual report outlook (balance, shortfall, payments, mikdamot_paid, deadline, configured)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L25-L29", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "If configured is false the declared side (salary, \u05de\u05d9\u05dc\u05d5\u05d0\u05d9\u05dd, withholding, advances) was never filled in, so the balance is meaningless and the agent asks for \u05d8\u05d5\u05e4\u05e1 106 and certificates."}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_deadlines_sweep", "label": "Tax deadlines sweep (\u05de\u05e2\u05f4\u05de 15th bi-monthly, \u05d1\u05d9\u05d8\u05d5\u05d7 \u05dc\u05d0\u05d5\u05de\u05d9 15th monthly, annual return)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L33-L38", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The annual-return date comes from outlook.deadline.file_by; when deadline.stated is false it is the default online-filing date, not the CPA quota date. Adjust for Shabbat/\u05d7\u05d2 postponements."}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_mikdamot_check", "label": "\u05de\u05e7\u05d3\u05de\u05d5\u05ea \u05de\u05e1 (income-tax advances) check", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L39-L51", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A shortfall found in August can still be discussed with the accountant; the same gap found next June is a lump sum plus \u05e8\u05d9\u05d1\u05d9\u05ea \u05d5\u05d4\u05e6\u05de\u05d3\u05d4. freelancer-profile.json says advances are NOT REQUIRED, but the filed 2025 return shows 46,066 NIS paid, so the claim must be re-verified."}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_threshold_watch", "label": "Threshold watch (500K NIS turnover -> 874 VAT report; \u05de\u05e1\u05e4\u05e8 \u05d4\u05e7\u05e6\u05d0\u05d4 above 10K NIS, 5K NIS from June 2026)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L52-L55", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_yearly_report_sheet", "label": "Yearly_Report sheet", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L56-L59", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_rates_year_pinning", "label": "Per-year tax-rate pinning (assessment.rates_year / rates_note)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L68-L73", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Brackets change yearly: quote the year the app used and flag rates_note. Lines marked \u05d4\u05e2\u05e8\u05db\u05d4 (estimated) are approximations, not assessed figures."}, {"id": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_advise_not_decide", "label": "Advise; the accountant decides (\u05dc\u05d1\u05d3\u05d5\u05e7 \u05de\u05d5\u05dc \u05e8\u05d5\u05d0\u05d4 \u05d4\u05d7\u05e9\u05d1\u05d5\u05df)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L66-L67", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A deadline is never marked paid without bank evidence or explicit user confirmation."}, {"id": "freelancer_profile", "label": "freelancer-profile.json", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "deadline_calendar", "label": "deadline-calendar.json", "file_type": "document", "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "claude_agents_tax_compliance_yearly_report_sheet", "target": "readme_google_sheets_data_layer", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": ".claude/agents/tax-compliance.md", "source_location": "L56", "weight": 1.0}, {"sourc